<title>USA: HealthCare Imaging FY96 loss widens.</title>
<headline>HealthCare Imaging FY96 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>MIDDLETOWN, N.J. 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year Ended December 31,</p>
<p>						     1996	     1995</p>
<p> Revenues				  $9,787,591	$9,249,284</p>
<p>Operating expenses before non-cash</p>
<p>  compensation charge		   8,738,374	 9,024,876</p>
<p> Loss on sale of equipment		     --	   191,181</p>
<p>Income before non-cash compensation</p>
<p>charge, minority interests in</p>
<p>  joint ventures and income taxes   1,049,217	    33,227</p>
<p>Minority interests in joint ventures</p>
<p>						(416,192)	 (293,924)</p>
<p> Non-cash compensation charge     (1,445,473)		  --</p>
<p>Operating loss before income taxes</p>
<p>						(812,448)	 (260,697)</p>
<p> Income tax provision (Benefit)	  49,348	 (142,267)</p>
<p> Net loss				   (861,796)	 (118,430)</p>
<p>Weighted average common shares</p>
<p>  outstanding			     4,711,974	 4,711,974</p>
<p> Net loss per common share		  (.18)	     (.03)</p>
<p>NOTES: Operating income was $1,049,217 before non-cash compensation charges, minority interests in joint ventures and income taxes. Net loss of $861,796 includes a non-cash compensation charge of $1,445,473, or $0.18 per share, for year ended December 31, 1996, vs operating income of $33,227, before minority interests in joint ventures and income taxes and net loss of $118,430, or $0.03 per share, for the year ended December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>Full company name is HealthCare Imaging Services Inc.</p>
